    "text": {
     "en": "Gopi is honest. He says he cannot keep the ball for himself, and he goes to ask his friends.\nThe friends tease and joke, which shows warm, playful friendship.\nThe ending is humorous because the ball they found is lost again in an instant.\nThe scooterist wears a helmet. Wearing a helmet is important for safety, and pillion riders should wear one too.\nThe story also shows how a simple outdoor game brings friends together.\n(additional, not in the textbook) It tells us to be honest, enjoy games with friends and follow road safety."
    }
